{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12966","headline":"雨後公超谷北原眺望寄高拾遗 · 独孤及","name":"雨後公超谷北原眺望寄高拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"崖口雨足收，清光洗高天。\n虹蜺敛残霭，山水含碧鲜。\n远空霞破露月轮，薄云片片成鱼鳞。\n五陵如荠渭如带，目极千里关山春。\n朝来爽气未易说，画取花峯赠远人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12966.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12966","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}